WEBVTT

00:00.500 --> 00:05.500
Arranging care can feel like a big step.

00:06.000 --> 00:10.000
You may wonder what the visit will be like.

00:10.500 --> 00:15.000
At Care Provider, it starts with a visit at home.

00:15.000 --> 00:19.500
We listen, talk through what you need, and meet your preferences.

00:20.000 --> 00:27.500
Ready to talk? Contact Care Provider on phone number or visit website.
